    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1257">

                <pb facs="0872" n="756" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg756"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/403.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Vice Consul Silliman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1914</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 19. Bring to attention of General Carranza following language in
                    quoted instructions from Señor Bonillas: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>With the understanding that no payment made to officer of the Huerta
                            Government since March 1st, 1913, is valid.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">and state that the Department assumes that this apparent
                    disregard of the right of American citizens and other foreigners, under the
                    principles international law, to pay taxes to persons exercising de facto
                    authority does not have General Carrana’s concurrence and that upon having the
                    matter called to his attention he will take appropriate action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
